OL,3,GNEWSACare home predator sexually
OL,4,Aassaulted my mum despite warnings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has told BBC News how his elderly
OL,7,Fmother, who was suffering from
OL,8,Fdementia, was sexually assaulted by a
OL,9,Ffellow resident in a care home in
OL,10,FInverclyde.
OL,12,FThe man - who we are calling John to
OL,13,Fprotect his mother's identity - said
OL,14,Fthe "horrific" sex attack took place
OL,15,Fdespite concerns previously being
OL,16,Fraised by staff about the behaviour of
OL,17,Fthe attacker.
