OL,3,GNEWSACare home predator sexually
OL,4,Aassaulted my mum despite warnings
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn told the BBC he was speaking out
OL,7,Fafter HC-One, which operates the Merino
OL,8,FCourt Care Home in Greenock, admitted
OL,9,Fliability and paid damages after a
OL,10,Fcivil action.
OL,12,FHe said he was angry that a criminal
OL,13,Finvestigation into the 2023 attack took
OL,14,Fso long that the man accused of the
OL,15,Fassault, who was in his 80s, was deemed
OL,16,Funfit to stand trial.
